WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.329
The Oort cloud's distance.

00:03.029 --> 00:05.767
The planets are now inside one pixel.

00:06.217 --> 00:15.017
Comets come from a cloud of icy bodies thought to lie between 5 000 and 100 000 times the Earth's distance from the Sun.

00:15.467 --> 00:19.902
Nothing is drawn here because none of them has ever been seen in place.
